# Quake-style drop-down terminal (kitty 0.42+)
# Trigger: bind a global hotkey once in
#   System Settings → Keyboard → Keyboard Shortcuts → Services → General → "Quick access to kitty"
# Or toggle from a shell: kitten quick-access-terminal
# Docs: https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/kittens/quick-access-terminal/

edge top
lines 20
background_opacity 0.9
hide_on_focus_loss yes
